# Single build output root, matching the sibling trees:
#   out\x64\<Configuration>\   the eight exes + the STAGED runtime DLLs
# Set in build.ps1. x64 by construction, not AnyCPU -- see the TARGET note there.
#
# The staged DLLs (MsgcoreCom, TargetCom, TargetFacade, Msgcore, TargetCore) are
# copies build.ps1 makes so that ONE Msgcore.dll is on the search path for both
# servers -- see the header of run_all.ps1. They are build output like any other.
out/

logs/
.vs/
*.user
